---
// About / Mission section
---

<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <!-- Left Column: National Info -->
    <div class="space-y-6 fade-in-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-akc-gold">
        <div class="h-px w-10 bg-akc-gold/60"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">Alpha Phi Sigma</span>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-akc-light leading-tight">
        The Criminal Justice<br/>
        <span class="text-gradient">Honor Society</span>
      </h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-akc-light/70 leading-relaxed border-l-2 border-akc-gold/30 pl-4 mt-6">
        <p>Certified Member of the Association of College Honor Societies</p>
        <p>Affiliated with the Academy of Criminal Justice Sciences</p>
        <a href="http://www.AlphaPhiSigma.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block mt-1 pt-2 text-akc-gold hover:text-akc-gold-light transition-colors font-medium">www.AlphaPhiSigma.org</a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/[0.08]">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-akc-gold mb-3">Recognizing & Promoting</h3>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-akc-light tracking-wide">
          Academic Excellence • Leadership • Service • Unity
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Join Info -->
    <div class="relative card-hover rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.03] p-6 sm:p-8 fade-in-right h-full">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-akc-gold/5 rounded-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-serif text-akc-light mb-6 leading-snug">
          JOIN THE ONLY <span class="text-gradient">ACCREDITED</span><br/>
          CRIMINAL JUSTICE HONOR SOCIETY
        </h3>
        
        <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-akc-light/75">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Join the thousands of members and alumni across the world.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Membership is based on academic excellence.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Acquire leadership skills, conduct community service and build unity among your chapter.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>You must apply and qualify for membership.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Apply with a major or minor in criminal justice or a related field.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Requirements for eligibility on our website or QR code below.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-akc-gold shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span>Meets one of the federal jobs qualifications for a GS-7 entry level pay.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/[0.08]">
          <p class="text-[13px] font-medium text-akc-light/90 mb-3">Get connected! Join Alpha Phi Sigma, THE Criminal Justice Honor Society.</p>
          <a href="https://alphaphisigma.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-akc-dark bg-akc-gold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-akc-gold-light transition-all duration-200">
            Visit alphaphisigma.org
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


